Question 1: SaaS and Cloud-Based Applications
A college currently maintains student attendance records manually using registers and Excel sheets. The institution plans to implement a cloud-based attendance management system that faculty members can access from anywhere.
Analyze how Software as a Service (SaaS) can be used to develop the proposed system. Identify its essential features, explain how cloud-based access benefits faculty and students, and discuss two possible challenges.
Expected contribution:
●	Introduction to SaaS
●	Proposed attendance management system
●	Minimum four essential features
●	Three benefits of cloud-based applications
●	Two challenges
●	Simple architecture diagram
